events.text:
if you’ve got spare capacity sitting around:

list it set your price in solana:9cRCn9rGT8V2imeM2BaKs13yhMEais3ruM3rPvTGpump when someone routes to you, you get paid

that’s it. idle endpoints stop being dead money. https://twitter.com/DevGwardo/status/2077878325658132719

if you just want to use models:

sign in with email (wallet works too) send some solana:9cRCn9rGT8V2imeM2BaKs13yhMEais3ruM3rPvTGpump to your deposit wallet hit Approve once grab an API key

you'll have to include a small amount of @solana (1/2)

